{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"de352b2aa977914b1fb5d817dcbe9f9f2257e26df6691033eed1dc24d1379fe3","ja":"あ、琴葉ちゃん、ちょっと時間いいかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"8ef2a19b1d43071d448b9543156e44bd6a07d4c054de2a5f099aa6d0d19349c7","ja":"はい、大丈夫です。\nなにかあったんですか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"b67b53f1b9067a27f2c0410824c953d428e662086f96d80c515b522ce0a42574","ja":"実は、私と志保ちゃんで\n大人のデートを考えて紹介するお仕事が来てるの。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c36dec81e4f8a99d08fc9ea23da5f2f244af3267e969ca025b5d639a9bb2e2b8","ja":"それで、デートコースを作ってみたんだけど、\nこれでいいか心配で……少し見てもらえないかな？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"045887db9ecceda1abb327e04214f72f8d13e4d365e31d1c05b96fbfda500210","ja":"わかりました。\nでも、私の意見でいいんでしょうか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"373f77c12dc3332be4476f6cb1202c667ea7d0394f6ee74f54889430c8d286bb","ja":"うん。琴葉ちゃんくらいの年齢の人にも、\n大人って思ってもらえるか聞いてみたくって。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"5e5062600590f5f293517a45491d1d441d7ae29f84909aca03afad2261aa4af8","ja":"そういうことでしたら、見させてもらいますね！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b6dfba2e229851885c340a7264c39cadea28ef84e6c5f18bd61de71ff3f59d8d","ja":"ど、どうかな……？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"5339e6c5784d58e316da08db46f8fd3ba29ffe1f9f9ac2fd94d2817d25be1912","ja":"そうですね……王道で楽しそうで、\nいいプランだと思いました。でも……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"9f8a045de3deaf4e445f60bce916b9d0d531d017dd6a699de0cae1599b5e088f","ja":"え、遠慮なく言ってね、琴葉ちゃん。\nおかしなデートを紹介する方が困るから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"f13c4c24747cad3f205756de70856e2b0f5ef6b7589429bf925916ea639726bd","ja":"私もよくは分からないんですけど……大人の人って、\nもっとドキドキするデートをするような気がして……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"513f00aa6daba04e68bb080829806ea4573a6ef825402f64da034e1f56727451","ja":"ドキドキ、か……。\nたしかに、そんな雰囲気はないかもしれないわね。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"fedfe8f319838088ba4f0aae79219b11aaa6c4e2aa2e90c840ff6a5a8396421d","ja":"大人らしさだけにこだわるんじゃなくて、風花さんが\nしたいデートを考えてみるのはどうでしょうか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"7e29113f149175d6482f51965a73ee5630bfb98568ef92568a00bea75a595309","ja":"そういう風花さんの気持ちが、一緒にいる人を\nドキドキさせるのかもって思うんですけど。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1354.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"ef9d176fcc120606823680aa37ded720c52e95201c08cbbd27329fcf8996a543","ja":"私がデートでしたいこと、か……。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
